re_item_assets/steam/apps/2957950/extras/e06401b5485cd084d0e83407dc128a62.webm?t=1755261897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957950/extras/e06401b5485cd084d0e83407dc128a62.mp4?t=1755261897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the Leviathan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sing for the soul of the oceans against pure evil rising from the darkest depths. Only by finding the ancient melody that truly resonates can you discover what lies beneath the creature's endless rage</p>",
